sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant M as McpAgent (/mcp)
    participant U as Upload handler (/upload/:id)
    participant K as UPLOAD_KV
    participant T as TOKEN_KV
    participant D as Google Drive

    Note over C: sha256 = sha256(file)
    C->>M: prepare_upload(filename, size, contentType, sha256)
    M->>M: uploadId = uuid()
    M->>M: sign HS256 JWT
    M->>K: put upload:<uploadId> status=pending
    M-->>C: { uploadId, uploadUrl, uploadToken, expiresAt }

    C->>U: PUT uploadUrl<br/>Authorization: Bearer <jwt><br/>body: file
    U->>U: verify JWT (uploadId, exp, maxSize)
    U->>K: get upload:<uploadId>
    K-->>U: record (pending)
    U->>T: get gtoken:<userId> (refresh if needed)
    T-->>U: access_token
    U->>D: POST /upload?uploadType=resumable
    D-->>U: Location (session URI)
    U->>D: PUT session URI<br/>body: TransformStream(sha256, size)
    D-->>U: { id, name, mimeType, size }
    U->>U: verify sha256 (if pre-bound)
    U->>K: put upload:<uploadId> status=completed
    U-->>C: 200 { accepted, actualSize, actualSha256, fileId }

    C->>M: complete_upload(uploadId, sha256)
    M->>K: get upload:<uploadId>
    K-->>M: record (completed, actualSha256, driveFileId)
    M->>M: verify userId + sha256 match
    M-->>C: { fileId, resourceUri, name, mimeType, size }
